#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:3
#: b535085801a84973adef456a78f715ac
msgid "有序合金原型（Ordered Alloy Prototype）"
msgstr "Ordered Alloy Prototype"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:5
#: c47ba08427bc4031b341ca4d253fcf93
msgid "**分类：** 合金与组分"
msgstr "**Category:** Alloys and Composition"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:7
#: aa1ec799a542448ea7d0de7a334c3db8
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:9
#: c0e89b0690804c3fbfd9e911bcf835cb
msgid ""
"生成带逐原子 `sublattice` 数组的 A1、A2、A3、L1₂、B2 或 L1₀ 基础晶胞。A/B 表示固定的晶体学位点身份，不占用磁性流程使用的 "
"`group`。"
msgstr ""
"Generate A1, A2, A3, L1₂, B2, or L1₀ primitive templates carrying a per-atom "
"`sublattice` array. A/B denotes fixed crystallographic site identities and does not "
"reuse the `group` field employed by magnetic workflows."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:11
#: acd06de38e5546e6bc7a1ee03052be8a
msgid "输出是带 A/B 子晶格身份的基础晶胞。需要更大结构时，在后面连接 [扩胞（Super Cell）](super-cell-card.md)。"
msgstr ""
"The output is a base cell with A/B sublattice identities. For a larger structure, "
"connect [Super Cell](super-cell-card.md) downstream."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:13
#: 023bcbb19e034619a8d84cc6b8740b60
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:15
#: fc313466dc6f4eebbabbfdb860f2e74f
#, python-brace-format
msgid "每个原型由晶胞矩阵 $\\mathbf C_0$、分数坐标 $\\{\\mathbf s_j\\}$ 和子晶格标签 $\\{\\lambda_j\\}$ 定义："
msgstr ""
"Each prototype is defined by a cell matrix $\\mathbf C_0$, fractional coordinates "
"$\\{\\mathbf s_j\\}$, and sublattice labels $\\{\\lambda_j\\}$:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:17
#: 1f0f271df99b490bbfbc229e7de6d7c9
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf r_j=\\mathbf s_j\\mathbf C_0,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\lambda_j\\in\\{A,B\\}.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:23
#: 851f4a5383b1478f8c9ad1a3400717d2
msgid "基础晶胞的位点数固定："
msgstr "The number of sites in each base cell is fixed:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md
#: 12ec92d17fb447bf94e3bee974ace3ee
msgid "原型"
msgstr "Prototype"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md
#: 161988e1978a4498a47cf3f043418377
msgid "位点数"
msgstr "Site Count"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md
#: 74a313e0656a483a99ee9d417c3f8fd8
msgid "子晶格计数"
msgstr "Sublattice counts"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md
#: e8c3739f4d734a4d81d955a91203f2eb
msgid "形状参数"
msgstr "Shape Parameter"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md
#: 87241a93a6c84893acc99e80816b4005
msgid "A1 / FCC"
msgstr "A1 / FCC"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md
#: 3fcf073eb5464ec7a6b04f420430305a
msgid "4"
msgstr "4"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md
#: 48a01bb7aaec421580510f662d82a21d
msgid "A=4"
msgstr "A=4"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md
#: 0960a135f2034529bc7e3fb04df3f9cd a9444ddd1dd84d23bc2c9e5462c87161
#: e9da8afc925a48d8b06c8df259fb3e1c fb9529be1091486088364bc61de9cd6b
msgid "立方"
msgstr "Cubic"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md
#: 12e11c8fb9784427b3e8ef8468d3083b
msgid "A2 / BCC"
msgstr "A2 / BCC"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md
#: 5ceec5c0e5ca4b9bb3a1e9372424196e
msgid "2"
msgstr "2"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md
#: dbcd0658af1543299e2f5dff59faf19d
msgid "A=2"
msgstr "A=2"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md
#: e9222b1fda304154896433e3d9dfd754
msgid "A3 / HCP"
msgstr "A3 / HCP"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md
#: 348d6282c6d24b76acaaed7edebf42a8 eb3bfa58f7544dea9c329399cd13991c
msgid "$c=a(c/a)$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md
#: 0d87a08f67e74c1e884473cbcde9135e
msgid "L1₂ / A₃B"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md
#: 5bcabcbcd331401ba6a106832c7735b0
msgid "A=3，B=1"
msgstr "A=3，B=1"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md
#: d053640f274842db97f63a49dc94bc84
msgid "B2 / AB"
msgstr "B2 / AB"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md
#: b1a4ecc182a64334a3ecc4a7443e12b7
msgid "A=1，B=1"
msgstr "A=1，B=1"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md
#: 64517282cb58406abaf079407fccf950
msgid "L1₀ / AB"
msgstr "L1₀ / AB"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md
#: 4fcae000291a4c60a009ce586e5c0a5b
msgid "A=2，B=2"
msgstr "A=2，B=2"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:34
#: 5b50d9e9ee8742e49e48bb25e1b56088
msgid ""
"连接“扩胞”卡后，坐标、元素和 `sublattice` 会一起复制。例如 L1₂ 基胞的 A:B=3:1 经 $2\\times2\\times2$ 扩胞后得到 "
"24:8。"
msgstr ""
"After connecting `Super Cell`, coordinates, elements, and `sublattice` are replicated"
" together. For example, an L1₂ base cell with A:B=3:1 becomes 24:8 after a "
"$2\\times2\\times2$ expansion."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:36
#: ce8d0bd2b80148b3a398fdd06787eeae
msgid "A1/A2/A3 与普通晶体原型的区别"
msgstr "How A1/A2/A3 Differ from Ordinary Crystal Prototypes"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:38
#: c68a98bc52bf43a78853186980aedae4
msgid ""
"它们在几何上分别等同于 FCC、BCC、HCP。仅当后续流程需要统一的 `sublattice=A` 标签或 `X` "
"占位符时才使用本卡；只需要单元素晶体时，优先使用“晶体原型构建”。"
msgstr ""
"Geometrically, they are equivalent to FCC, BCC, and HCP, respectively. Use this card "
"only when downstream operations require a uniform `sublattice=A` label or `X` "
"placeholders. For an ordinary single-element crystal, prefer `Crystal Prototype "
"Builder`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:40
#: 54ce7b8c5fee44aa894f2d94308483b4
msgid "X 占位符"
msgstr "The X Placeholder"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:42
#: fa43499f7df5491694d24cff579ece82
msgid "`X` 表示尚未确定的元素位点，原子序数为 0，不能直接用于训练或 DFT。含 `X` 的结构应先经过“有限晶胞合金占位”，将每个位点替换为真实元素。"
msgstr ""
"`X` marks a site whose element has not yet been assigned. Its atomic number is 0, so "
"it cannot be used directly for training or DFT. A structure containing `X` should "
"pass through `Finite-Cell Alloy Occupancy` first, replacing every site with a real "
"element."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:44
#: 2e687f1cae1343a098d1452f9f4159bc
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:46
#: 0d87a08f67e74c1e884473cbcde9135e
msgid "生成 L1₂ 的 32 位点占位模板"
msgstr "Generate a 32-Site L1₂ Occupancy Template"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:48
#: 182042f0ced04e7087ffb6ac5f8e8c5c
msgid "选择 `L1₂ / A₃B`，晶格常数设为单点；"
msgstr "Select `L1₂ / A₃B` and use a single lattice-constant value;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:49
#: df07a98fe3154f379a76768d4472ee35
msgid "A、B 均保留 `X`，预览应显示基础晶胞 A=3、B=1；"
msgstr "leave both A and B as `X`; the preview should show A=3 and B=1 in the base cell;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:50
#: e559fbc317ba4ca2a3a455c01b83aba9
msgid "后接“扩胞”，设为 $2\\times2\\times2$，得到 A=24、B=8；"
msgstr "connect `Super Cell` with $2\\times2\\times2$, giving A=24 and B=8;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:51
#: abbdb072dc7441dbacd79eee37dd9ff3
msgid "后接“有限晶胞合金占位”，分别为 A/B 子晶格设置真实元素和整数计数。"
msgstr ""
"then connect `Finite-Cell Alloy Occupancy` and assign real elements with integer "
"counts separately for the A and B sublattices."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:53
#: 44631ec93ad14dabb3552a92d10782e2
msgid "若模型在 L1₂ 相的误差偏高，应在 DFT 标注和重训后按原型、子晶格占位程度分别比较能量和力误差，而不是只看混合总 RMSE。"
msgstr ""
"If model errors are high for the L1₂ phase, compare energy and force errors after DFT"
" labeling and retraining separately by prototype and degree of sublattice occupancy, "
"rather than relying only on an aggregate mixed RMSE."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:55
#: d1a5490561474dfe947d2fd420a8b196
msgid "直接生成 Cu₃Au"
msgstr "Generate Cu₃Au Directly"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:57
#: 7e1df2ab846348cb8a9c48c8c56ffcbb
msgid "选择 `L1₂ / A₃B`，A 填 `Cu`、B 填 `Au`。输出即为固定 3:1 化学计量的 Cu₃Au 基胞；需要更大结构时，后接“扩胞”即可。"
msgstr ""
"Select `L1₂ / A₃B`, enter `Cu` for A and `Au` for B. The output is a Cu₃Au base cell "
"with fixed 3:1 stoichiometry. Connect `Super Cell` if a larger structure is needed."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:59
#: f44c58ae5ae94d789886535379f160e4
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:61
#: 5783e05ba5e948aa91818160cd011850
msgid "有序原型（prototype）"
msgstr "Ordered Prototype (prototype)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:63
#: f91c4c4f204d428e85b5d2a18b17f7ca
msgid "`str`，默认 `L12/A3B`。可选 `A1/fcc`、`A2/bcc`、`A3/hcp`、`L12/A3B`、`B2/AB`、`L10/AB`，位点定义见上表。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `L12/A3B`. Available values are `A1/fcc`, `A2/bcc`, `A3/hcp`, "
"`L12/A3B`, `B2/AB`, and `L10/AB`; site definitions are given in the table above."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:65
#: e1171a2ec3b64f31a1d3ee2dae768a64
msgid "晶格常数范围（a_range）"
msgstr "Lattice-Constant Range (a_range)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:67
#: 56885334f93048c4889c887db2855198
msgid ""
"`tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(3.75, 3.75, 0.1)`，单位 Å，依次为起点、终点、正步长。默认值对应常见 Cu₃Au "
"L1₂ 基胞；反向端点会交换，每个采样点输出一个基础晶胞。"
msgstr ""
"`tuple[float, float, float]`, default `(3.75, 3.75, 0.1)`, in Å, giving start, stop, "
"and positive step. The default corresponds to a common Cu₃Au L1₂ cell. Reversed "
"endpoints are swapped, and each sampled value produces one base cell."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:69
#: 12afb19373644d828be261a09a099d54
msgid "晶格轴比（covera）"
msgstr "Lattice Axial Ratio (covera)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:71
#: 28e80208994c4a9f90b8a3fdff021cef
msgid "`float`，默认 `1.0`。仅 A3/HCP 和 L1₀ 显示并生效，定义 $c/a$；立方原型固定为 1。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `1.0`. Displayed and used only for A3/HCP and L1₀, where it defines "
"$c/a$; cubic prototypes use a fixed value of 1."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:73
#: 1b97bcdb5a404d7c9daeb681862111b2
msgid "子晶格元素（sublattice_elements）"
msgstr "sublattice_elements"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:75
#: 407004d7dec3439483e2f5687bd53793
msgid "`str`，默认 `A:Cu,B:Au`，可直接生成 Cu₃Au。界面将其拆成 A、B 两个独立输入框；单子晶格原型只显示 A。每项接受一个真实元素符号或 `X`。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `A:Cu,B:Au`, which directly generates Cu₃Au. The interface presents "
"this as separate A and B inputs; single-sublattice prototypes display only A. Each "
"entry accepts one real element symbol or `X`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:77
#: 80d47f54d2124fb59ffc4cc6149dd97f
msgid "最大输出数（max_outputs）"
msgstr "max_outputs"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:79
#: 9e8e67eac93d455a8d2264a980ef0a62
msgid "`int`，默认 `200`，至少为 1。若 `a` 扫描点更多，只输出从较小 $a$ 开始的前几个点；界面会提前显示截断。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `200`, with a minimum of 1. If the `a` scan contains more points, only"
" the first values starting from the smaller $a$ are output; the interface previews "
"this truncation."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:81
#: 51fd33adb84c4849b38c80232451aa11
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:83
#: 4fe8b2f79a5649699315702d4fcb73eb
msgid "**在哪里设置原子数或重复倍率？** 在本卡后连接“扩胞”卡。扩胞会保留 `sublattice` 数组。"
msgstr ""
"**Where are the atom count and repeat factors set?** Connect `Super Cell` after this "
"card. The expansion preserves the `sublattice` array."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:85
#: 37fc8f25d4404b8d8d8309595054fb5e
msgid "**A1/A2/A3 应该选本卡还是晶体原型卡？** 需要子晶格标签或 `X` 占位时选本卡；只生成普通单元素 FCC/BCC/HCP 时选晶体原型卡。"
msgstr ""
"**Should A1/A2/A3 use this card or Crystal Prototype Builder?** Use this card when "
"sublattice labels or `X` placeholders are needed. Use Crystal Prototype Builder for "
"ordinary single-element FCC/BCC/HCP structures."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:87
#: 0aeaf9adb43e4582801cf49e3f6da7ed
msgid "**旧配置为什么不再按内部倍率扩胞？** 旧版扩胞字段已经移除。加载时会显示迁移提示，请补上一张“扩胞”卡恢复尺寸。"
msgstr ""
"**Why does a legacy configuration no longer expand by its internal repeat factors?** "
"The old expansion fields were removed. A migration notice is shown when loading; add "
"a `Super Cell` card to restore the intended size."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:89
#: c621ef993b0440589dc4c828d605e9d5
msgid "输出合同"
msgstr "Output Contract"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:91
#: 62650da852a2453e97f3bda793022689
msgid "每个 $a$ 点输出一个具有理想原型坐标的三维周期基础晶胞。"
msgstr ""
"Each $a$ value produces one three-dimensionally periodic base cell with ideal "
"prototype coordinates."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:92
#: cd03c6d9b7244e688de98981e4a948c8
msgid "`atoms.arrays[\"sublattice\"]` 保存逐原子 A/B 标签。"
msgstr "`atoms.arrays[\"sublattice\"]` stores per-atom A/B labels."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:93
#: e6865afd116c4055968cd8df9572d4af
msgid "`ordered_alloy_prototype` metadata 保存原型、晶格参数、原型阶段的元素映射和当前结构的子晶格计数；经过“扩胞”后计数会同步更新。"
msgstr ""
"The `ordered_alloy_prototype` metadata stores the prototype, lattice parameters, "
"element mapping at the prototype stage, and current sublattice counts. The counts are"
" updated after `Super Cell` expansion."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:94
#: e45d3fb246e44f8bacaf0a7a1cf7a6f8
msgid "`Config_type` 追加 `OrderedProto(<prototype>,a=<a>)`。"
msgstr "`OrderedProto(<prototype>,a=<a>)` is appended to `Config_type`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:99
#: aa5ff542bf2840c1905c59b356caa55b
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"OrderedAlloyPrototypeCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"prototype\": \"L12/A3B\",\n"
"    \"a_range\": [3.75, 3.75, 0.1],\n"
"    \"covera\": 1.0,\n"
"    \"sublattice_elements\": \"A:Cu,B:Au\",\n"
"    \"max_outputs\": 1\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"OrderedAlloyPrototypeCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"prototype\": \"L12/A3B\",\n"
"    \"a_range\": [3.75, 3.75, 0.1],\n"
"    \"covera\": 1.0,\n"
"    \"sublattice_elements\": \"A:Cu,B:Au\",\n"
"    \"max_outputs\": 1\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"

#~ msgid "`Group`: `Alloy` | `Class`: `OrderedAlloyPrototypeCard`"
#~ msgstr "`Group`: `Alloy` | `Class`: `OrderedAlloyPrototypeCard`"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**输入：** 无需输入结构。 **目标：** 先生成 32 原子的 L1₂ "
#~ "周期超胞，其中 A、B 子晶格严格为 24:8。 **参数设置：** "
#~ "`prototype=\"L12/A3B\"`，`a_range=[3.6,3.6,0.1]`，`sublattice_elements=\"A:X,B:X\"`，手动"
#~ " `rep=[2,2,2]`，`max_atoms=32`。 **输出：** 一个 32 "
#~ "原子周期结构，`sublattice` 中有 24 个 `A` 和 8 个"
#~ " `B`。 **怎么验证训练集质量改善：** 下游分别约束 A/B 占位并完成 DFT "
#~ "标注后，按原型和子晶格无序程度切片比较能量/力误差；不能只看混合后的总 RMSE。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Input:** none. **Goal:** first generate a "
#~ "periodic 32-atom L1₂ supercell with a strict"
#~ " A:B sublattice ratio of 24:8. **Parameters:**"
#~ " `prototype=\"L12/A3B\"`, `a_range=[3.6,3.6,0.1]`, "
#~ "`sublattice_elements=\"A:X,B:X\"`, manual `rep=[2,2,2]`, and "
#~ "`max_atoms=32`. **Output:** one periodic 32-atom "
#~ "structure whose `sublattice` array contains 24 "
